{"id":"encuentro","lemma":"encuentro","pos":"noun","rank":755,"glosses":["encounter, meeting","dispute, row","match, game"],"ipa":"/enˈkwentɾo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"encuentros"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-encuentro.wav","examples":[{"text":"Al fin te encuentro.","en":"Here you are.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/425171"},{"text":"Él sabe que no me gustan los encuentros cara a cara.","en":"He knows I don't like face to face meetings.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77680"},{"text":"Me encuentro mucho mejor.","en":"I feel much better.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799523"},{"text":"Después de vencer en todos los encuentros, obtuvo el título de campeón.","en":"After winning all the matches, he got the title of champion."},{"text":"No encuentro mis zapatos.","en":"I can't find my shoes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/68142"}]}